  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonella Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T09:47:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T09:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Um, I want to report a coyote. I see it this morning near the playground, the one by my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T09:48:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh my goodness, a coyote, in the daytime? Where is this, hon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T09:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "413 Ruggles Avenue. Historic Hill. The playground is just down from there. It was walking along the fence, slow, like nothing bothers it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T09:48:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I've got that down. Was anybody at the playground?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T09:48:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no kids, too early. But I am annoyed, because now I cannot stop looking out the window. I have a big pot of chowder to make for a gathering today, I have no time for this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T09:48:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that sounds like a good gathering. I'll pass this along to animal control."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T09:48:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So animal control is the one who responds? Or it is police? I want to know who comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T09:48:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Animal control handles it, and they'll call you if they need more. Can I have a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T09:48:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 401-555-0198. Thank you. Okay, bye."
    }
  ],
